      Copyright (c) 2007-26 Mike Karlesky, Mark VanderVoord & Greg Williams.
      Distributed under the MIT license; the full text is preserved verbatim
      in `test/unity/LICENSE.txt`.

  Libraries/Ethernet/ lwIP TCP/IP stack
      Copyright (c) Swedish Institute of Computer Science and contributors.
      Distributed under the 3-clause BSD license; see the per-file headers.
      The Infineon GETH port and the RTL8211F PHY driver in the same tree are
      under the Boost Software License 1.0 as stated in their headers.

